>> servings: 4

Preheat oven to 200 degrees Celsius.

Cook @bacon{1%pack}, preferably bits, in a pan until well cooked but not crispy. They will crisp up more in the oven.

Mix @eggs{6}, @olive oil{1%tsp} and @milk{1%tbsp} in a bowl and whisk until fluffly. Add some @salt{} and @pepper{}.

Add some jalapeno juice from the jar into the bowl. The more you put, the spicier it will be.

Pour egg mixture evenly into #cupcake tray{}.

Into each cupcake section, put some @bacon{}, @feta cheese{1%disc} and @pickled jalapeno{1/4%jar}. Divide these up equally among the 12 egg cups. Stir with a spoon to mix in.

Put the cupcake tray into the oven for 20 minutes.
